## Reporting back

Lead with what changed: leads posted, leads skipped as spam (and why), resubmissions, contacts stamped as MQL. Then flag, specifically:

- Leads that don't fit ICP and why
- Existing duplicate clusters found in Salesforce
- Account names that disagree between Salesforce and the sheet
- Stale field values on existing accounts (don't edit other reps' records — report them)
- Bad IDs in the sheet: dead AccountIds, or Contact IDs in the AccountId column
- Accounts with 0 activity that aren't newly created — an old untouched account is a signal
- Any conflict between what the lead submitted on the form and what research shows
- Any step that failed (MQL stamp, sheet write, label, Slack) so it can be finished by hand

If the sweep finds nothing new, end with "No new Jairus leads."
